        },
        {
          "type": "bullets",
          "items": [
            "{icon:docker} ==Image== = read-only template of layers plus config",
            "==Container== = running instance plus a thin **writable** layer",
            "`COPY` just copies; `ADD` also untars and fetches URLs, so prefer COPY",
            "==Multi-stage== builds copy only artifacts out, leaving compilers behind"
          ],
          "style": "star",
          "frame": "dashed",
          "ink": "green"
